WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:06,270
This noise-making device can be used with most household appliances

2
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:07,790
It is also convenient for emergencies during power outages.

3
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:11,500
I need both of them. I’ll also need to carry a few more sets of commonly used accessories and damaged ones.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,260
By the way, do you have any channels to buy fuel?

5
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,740
The suppliers we cooperate with can prepare it, but the quantity cannot be too large.

6
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:17,500
Twenty barrels will be enough for normal use.

7
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:35,520
Solar energy is a long-term backup, and generators are useful in critical times.

8
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:38,720
Energy is enough for now, but the most important category is still missing.

9
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:47,080
Medicine. I want to purchase a batch of commonly used medicines in bulk.

10
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:49,640
Do you know any salesperson? The volume is relatively large and it is difficult to buy ordinary oil and electricity.

11
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:51,880
Wait a minute. I'll recommend a sales representative from a pharmaceutical company to you.

12
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,440
I've worked with him before and he's pretty reliable.
